{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#card-zh","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-innersense 是面向 DSH web 客户端的本地个人事件记录与观察面板插件。它向 DSH 注册事件记录和查询工具，并在界面提供右侧面板，展示 MEL、RRI、ROI、ARCTIC、TSA 五项指标、MEL 与 RRI 的时间曲线及最近事件。用户可查看今日概览、按日期或标签查询历史、读取事件详情，也可在明确要求时记录或修正事件。事件保存在本机 SQLite 数据库中，默认路径为 $DSH_HOME/introspect/events.sqlite3；插件不要求额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:52-94","src/tools.js:241-370","src/db/database.js:22-53","src/db/view.js:84-120"]}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#card-en","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-innersense records and queries events through DSH web tools. Its right-side panel displays five metrics, a MEL and RRI timeline, and recent events. Data is stored in local SQLite at $DSH_HOME/introspect/events.sqlite3 by default; no extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:52-94","src/tools.js:241-370","src/db/database.js:22-53","src/db/view.js:84-120"]}
