{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-1","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-innersense README · dsh-innersense：> [!NOTE]\n> 🧪 **Experimental.** An early prototype from the [guhanfei-ai](https://github.com/guhanfei-ai) lab: the idea is serious, the code is a first cut. There is no stable release yet; APIs, data formats and behavior may change without notice, so it is not recommended for production. Ideas and issues are welcome.\n\n**InnerSense** — interoception for DeepSeek Harness. [dsh-worldsense](https://github.com/guhanfei-ai/dsh-worldsense) senses the world outside; InnerSense senses you.","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-innersense"}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-2","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-innersense README · dsh-innersense：Local-first self-observability for DeepSeek Harness.\n\nObserve your events, energy, time, value, direction and reality feedback — locally.\n\n> Observe the world. Introspect the self.\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-innersense"}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-3","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-innersense README · What it does：Records real events into a local SQLite database and projects them onto five observation axes:\n\n| Axis | Question | Range |\n|------|----------|-------|\n| **MEL** | How much usable mental energy is available? | 0–200 |\n| **RRI** | Did the real world observably move? | 0–100 |\n| **ROI** | What did this return to me relative to what it cost? | unbounded |\n| **ARCTIC** | Did this move me toward where I want to go? | -10..+10 |\n| **TSA** | How much finite time did this consume? | minutes, nullable |","source":"extracted","section":"What it does"}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-4","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-innersense README · What it does：The right-side InnerSense panel shows all five, a **MEL × RRI** time series, and recent events.\n\n**Why MEL × RRI?** High internal energy does not necessarily imply high external progress. InnerSense deliberately keeps mental energy and reality feedback as separate dimensions so you can see when they diverge.\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"What it does"}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-5","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-innersense README · Install：```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-innersense\n```\n\nOr from a local checkout:\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add link:/path/to/dsh-innersense\n```\n\nOr from a published tag:\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile <profile> add <pkg>#v<version>\n```\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"Install"}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-6","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-innersense README · Tools：| Tool | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `introspect_record` | Store one event (only when the user explicitly asks to record). |\n| `introspect_status` | Today's compact state block. |\n| `introspect_today` | Today's aggregation and timeline. |\n| `introspect_history` | Bounded multi-day query with filters and sorting. |\n| `introspect_get` | One event with its verbatim raw text. |\n| `introspect_update` | Correct a score when the user says it is wrong. |\n| `introspect_delete` | Remove one event (requires explicit user confirmation). |","source":"extracted","section":"Tools"}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-8","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-innersense README · How it works：```\nYou describe what happened\n    ↓\nDeepSeek Harness model understands the event\n    ↓\n\n- The plugin itself never calls any LLM.\n- Events are recorded only when you explicitly ask (\"记录一下\", \"记一笔\", \"/self ...\").\n- All data stays in `$DSH_HOME/introspect/events.sqlite3` on your machine.\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"How it works"}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-9","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-innersense README · Right-side panel：The Introspect panel (toggle with the \"内观\" button) shows:\n\n1. **Five metrics** — latest MEL, RRI, ROI, ARCTIC, TSA with trend arrows and averages.\n2. **MEL × RRI chart** — dual-line time series with the energy-reality gap shaded between them.\n3. **Recent events** — click to expand full details (raw text, all metrics with reasons, tags).\n4. **Live refresh** — the panel updates automatically after each recorded event.\n\nSupports dark mode and light mode (follows the DeepSeek Harness theme).\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"Right-side panel"}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-10","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-innersense README · Data：| Item | Location |\n|------|----------|\n| Database | `$DSH_HOME/introspect/events.sqlite3` |\n| Schema | `PRAGMA user_version`, single `events` table |\n| Backup | Copy the `.sqlite3` file; it's a standard SQLite database |\n\nOverride with `dbPath` in the plugin config (`cordis.patch.yml`).\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"Data"}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-11","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-innersense README · Privacy：- **No cloud account.** No registration, no login, no remote identity.\n- **No upload.** The plugin does not send its database or any event data to any external service.\n- **No external AI calls.** The plugin calls no LLM API directly.\n- **No telemetry.** No analytics, no usage tracking.\n- **No auto-capture.** Only explicitly requested events are stored.","source":"extracted","section":"Privacy"}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-12","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-innersense README · Privacy：If the DeepSeek Harness session uses a remote AI provider, the conversation content (including event descriptions) may transit that provider's infrastructure. The plugin controls only its own local storage.\n\nSee [docs/PRIVACY.md](docs/PRIVACY.md) for the full statement.\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"Privacy"}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-13","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-innersense README · Development：```bash\nnpm install\nnpm run build:client   # build client.js from src/client/ fragments\nnpm test               # run all tests\nnpm run verify         # build + syntax check + test\n\nTests cover: SQLite initialization, migration, CRUD, unicode, null metrics, timezone boundaries, tool validation, approval hooks, API trust fence, client pure functions, chart geometry, and secret/hygiene scans.\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"Development"}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-14","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-innersense README · Metrics documentation：See [docs/METRICS.md](docs/METRICS.md) for the full definition of each axis, their ranges, bands, aggregation rules, and limitations.\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"Metrics documentation"}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-15","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-innersense README · Architecture：See [docs/ARCHITECTURE.md](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md).\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"Architecture"}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-17","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-innersense README · dsh-innersense：> [!NOTE]\n> 🧪 **实验阶段。** 这是 [古寒飞AI](https://github.com/guhanfei-ai) 实验室里的早期原型：想法是认真的，代码还是第一版。目前没有稳定版本，接口、数据格式和行为都可能随时调整，不建议用于生产环境。欢迎提 issue 聊想法。\n\n**InnerSense（向内感知）**：DeepSeek Harness 的内感受（interoception）插件。[dsh-worldsense](https://github.com/guhanfei-ai/dsh-worldsense) 向外感知世界，InnerSense 向内感知你自己。\n\nDeepSeek Harness 中的本地个人可观测系统。\n\n在本地观察你的事件、能量、时间、价值、方向与现实反馈。\n\n> 观察世界，内观自己。\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-innersense"}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-18","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-innersense README · 它做什么：把真实事件记录到本地 SQLite 数据库，并投影到五个观察维度：\n\n| 维度 | 回答的问题 | 量纲 |\n|------|----------|------|\n| **MEL** | 现在还有多少可用心智能量？ | 0–200 |\n| **RRI** | 现实世界真的动了吗？ | 0–100 |\n| **ROI** | 这次交换对我而言回报如何？ | 无界 |\n| **ARCTIC** | 这让我离想去的地方更近还是更远？ | -10..+10 |\n| **TSA** | 这消耗了多少有限时间？ | 分钟，可空 |\n\n右侧「向内感知」面板同时显示全部五个指标、一条 **MEL × RRI** 时间曲线和最近事件。\n\n**为什么要同时看 MEL 和 RRI？** 内在能量高，并不自动意味着现实推进程度高。InnerSense 将心智能量与现实反馈作为两个独立维度观察，让两条线的差距自己说话。\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"它做什么"}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-19","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-innersense README · 安装：```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-innersense\n```\n\n或从本地目录：\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add link:/path/to/dsh-innersense\n```\n\n或发布 tag：\n\n```bash\ndsh plugin --profile <profile> add <pkg>#v<version>\n```\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-20","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-innersense README · 工具：| 工具 | 说明 |\n|------|------|\n| `introspect_record` | 记录一条事件（仅在用户明确要求时调用）。 |\n| `introspect_status` | 今日紧凑状态块。 |\n| `introspect_today` | 今日聚合与时间线。 |\n| `introspect_history` | 有界多日查询，支持过滤和排序。 |\n| `introspect_get` | 按 id 读取完整事件（含原始文本）。 |\n| `introspect_update` | 用户纠正评分时修改事件。 |\n| `introspect_delete` | 删除一条事件（需用户明确确认）。 |\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"工具"}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-21","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-innersense README · 工作原理：```\n你描述刚刚发生了什么\n    ↓\nDeepSeek Harness 模型理解事件\n    ↓\n\n- 插件本身绝不调用任何 LLM。\n- 只有你明确要求记录时才会写入（\"记录一下\"、\"记一笔\"、\"/self ...\"）。\n- 所有数据保存在本机 `$DSH_HOME/introspect/events.sqlite3`。\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"工作原理"}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-22","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-innersense README · 右侧面板：点击「内观」按钮展开面板，内容包括：\n\n1. **五个指标** — MEL、RRI、ROI、ARCTIC、TSA 的最新值、趋势箭头与平均值。\n2. **MEL × RRI 曲线** — 双线时间序列，两条线之间的区域就是能量—现实反馈差。\n3. **最近事件** — 点击展开完整详情（原始文本、全部指标及理由、标签）。\n4. **实时刷新** — 每次记录新事件后面板自动更新。\n\n支持深色模式和浅色模式（跟随 DeepSeek Harness 主题）。\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"右侧面板"}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-23","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-innersense README · 数据：| 项目 | 位置 |\n|------|------|\n| 数据库 | `$DSH_HOME/introspect/events.sqlite3` |\n| Schema | `PRAGMA user_version`，单一 `events` 表 |\n| 备份 | 复制 `.sqlite3` 文件即可；它是标准 SQLite 数据库 |\n\n可通过 `cordis.patch.yml` 中的 `dbPath` 覆盖路径。\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"数据"}
{"unit_id":"guhanfei-ai__dsh-innersense#readme-24","repo":"guhanfei-ai/dsh-innersense","commit":"11b90980b076a0103141268bfdc98002e1e852cb","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-innersense README · 隐私：- **不需要云账号。** 无注册、无登录、无远程身份。\n- **不上传。** 插件不向任何外部服务发送数据库或事件数据。\n- **不调用外部 AI。** 插件自身不调用任何 LLM API。\n- **不发送遥测。** 无分析、无使用追踪。\n- **不自动记录。** 只有明确请求的事件才会被存储。\n\n如果 DeepSeek Harness 会话使用远程 AI 供应商，对话内容（包括事件描述）可能会经过该供应商的基础设施。插件只控制自己的本地存储。\n\n完整说明见 [docs/PRIVACY.md](docs/PRIVACY.md)。\n\n---","source":"extracted","section":"隐私"}
